abstract: "Article/clause/point-level knowledge graph of Vietnamese civil law
  (20 corpus laws, 13,151 chunks, entity and relation layers) with validity
  intervals, verified amendment and succession edges, and a stratified temporal
  QA benchmark of 451 published questions in three audited cohorts: 281 core
  (12 hand-authored, 269 generated), 106 extension round 1, and 64 extension
  round 2 from the 1996-2015 statute era, plus a publicly quarantined pool of
  226 rejected candidates. All gold labels carry multi-round adjudication
  trails; no question remains in an unverifiable state."
